WEBVTT

00:03:25.881 --> 00:03:30.823
chunki gapiruvchi daraxt chindan ham
ahmoqona ko'rinadi.

00:03:30.823 --> 00:03:32.865
Olov esingizdami?

00:03:32.865 --> 00:03:35.526
Ikkita olov birgalikda — juda issiq.

00:03:35.526 --> 00:03:38.385
Uchta olov — juda katta olov.

00:03:38.385 --> 00:03:42.986
Olovni ikkita eshikni tagiga
joylashtiring — bu yong'in.

00:03:42.986 --> 00:03:46.078
Biz uchun quyosh — farovonlik manbai.

00:03:46.078 --> 00:03:48.257
Ikkita quyosh — rivojlanayotgan degani.

00:03:48.257 --> 00:03:50.615
Uchtasi birgalikda — bu uchqunlar.

00:03:50.615 --> 00:03:52.636
Agar quyosh va oyni birlashtirsak —

00:03:52.636 --> 00:03:53.944
bu yorug'lik.

00:03:53.944 --> 00:03:58.169
Yana bu ertaga, kun va tundan keyin degan
ma'noni ham beradi.

00:03:58.169 --> 00:04:02.652
Quyosh ufqdan tepaga ko'tariladi.
Quyosh chiqishi.